OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Finitially fading during the evening,
OL,7,Fbecoming largely dry overnight with
OL,8,Fclear spells. Showers return around
OL,9,Fdawn on Friday. Staying breezy along
OL,10,Fcoasts. A notably chillier night than
OL,11,Fof late.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FEarly morning showers clearing
OL,14,Fsouthwards to leave a largely dry day.
OL,15,FAlthough rather cloudy, some bright
OL,16,Fspells could emerge, particularly
OL,17,Flater on. Temperatures below the
OL,18,Fseasonal average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
